WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.033 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Keep the window out of your way.
Collapse companion returns to the mascot without signing you out.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:14.500 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Open it when you need context.
Click the mascot to return to the same conversation.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:22.467 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Read the task card.
A task card collapses to a summary and opens when you need the list.

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:28.733 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Choose work for review.
Selecting a task does not complete it. Review is a separate step.

00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:35.000 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Review before a change.
Mark selected done opens the proposed action for your decision.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.950 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Keep it within reach.
Collapse companion returns to the compact mascot. It does not sign you out.
